r=g.$2("\ud83c\udf10 Architecture R\xe9seau Multi-Site : VPN & Haute Disponibilit\xe9","\ud83c\udf10 Secure Multi-Site Architecture: VPN & High Availability")
o=g.$2("Ing\xe9nierie R\xe9seau & Infrastructure","Network Engineering & Infrastructure")
q=g.$2("Infrastructure multi-sites : VPN (IPSec/SSL), Haute Disponibilit\xe9 (HSRP) et S\xe9curit\xe9.","Design of a corporate infrastructure connecting three critical sites: VPN Tunnels (IPSec/SSL), High Availability (HSRP), and Advanced Security.")
p=g.$2("Ce projet d'ing\xe9nierie simule la refonte compl\xe8te d'une infrastructure r\xe9seau r\xe9partie sur trois sites g\xe9ographiques. L'enjeu majeur \xe9tait de garantir une continuit\xe9 de service totale et une confidentialit\xe9 des \xe9changes inter-sites.\n\nJ'ai d\xe9ploy\xe9 une architecture hi\xe9rarchique Cisco int\xe9grant :\n\u2022 Interconnexion Crypt\xe9e : Mise en place de tunnels VPN IPSec (Site-\xe0-Site) pour relier les agences et de VPN SSL pour les acc\xe8s distants s\xe9curis\xe9s.\n\u2022 Haute Disponibilit\xe9 : Impl\xe9mentation du protocole HSRP pour la redondance des passerelles et RSTP pour la r\xe9silience de niveau 2.\n\u2022 Routage & S\xe9curit\xe9 Renforc\xe9e : Configuration d'OSPF multi-aires, filtrage p\xe9rim\xe9trique via pare-feu ASA et verrouillage des acc\xe8s locaux (DHCP Snooping, DAI, Port-Security).","This engineering project simulates the complete overhaul of a network infrastructure distributed across three geographic sites. The main goal was to ensure total service continuity and confidentiality of inter-site exchanges.\n\nI deployed a hierarchical Cisco architecture integrating:\n\u2022 Encrypted Interconnection: Implementation of IPSec VPN tunnels (Site-to-Site) to connect branches and SSL VPN for secure remote access.\n\u2022 High Availability: Implementation of HSRP protocol for gateway redundancy and RSTP for Layer 2 resilience.\n\u2022 Routing & Hardened Security: Multi-area OSPF configuration, perimeter filtering via ASA firewalls, and local access locking (DHCP Snooping, DAI, Port-Security).")
